&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Time to first number&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;A few days to collect and process after setup&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
